# "When Emrakul is put into a graveyard from anywhere": here from the hand. Bot1 holds Emrakul among eight cards after its
# turn-3 draw, discards it to the hand size (CR 514.1), and Emrakul's trigger then shuffles the graveyard, with Emrakul in
# it, into the library: the graveyard is empty again and the library one card larger than the turn before.

[Bot1 Deck]
Emrakul, the Aeons Torn
Island x6
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Library.Count = 19
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Discard(Emrakul, the Aeons Torn)
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Library.Count = 20
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
